# Mojo Guidelines

- Docs: https://docs.modular.com/mojo/manual/
- Use `mojo format` for consistent formatting
- Run via: `pixi run mojo <file>.mojo`

## Key Patterns
- Use `@parameter` for compile-time parallelization closures
- Use `parallelize[fn](count)` for CPU parallelization
- Prefer `List[T]` over raw pointers for memory safety
- Use `var` for mutable, omit for immutable bindings

## GPU (CuPy)
- Check `has_nvidia_gpu_accelerator()` before GPU paths
- Use `cp.asarray()` for host-to-device transfers
- Vectorized array ops (roll, isin) are faster than loops
